{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p004468","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p004468"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p004468","label":"周公引古（春申君列傳候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"周公","mention_ids":["c-shiji-078-chunshen:m019-0126"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-078-chunshen:m019-0126","chapter_id":"c-shiji-078-chunshen","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-078-chunshen:p019","quote":"周公"}]}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-078-chunshen","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-078","chapter_id":"c-shiji-078-chunshen","mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-078-chunshen:m019-0126"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-078-chunshen:p019"],"passage_count":1}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji-078-chunshen"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-078-chunshen:m019-0126","start":126,"end":128,"surface":"周公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004468","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-078-chunshen:p019","chapter_id":"c-shiji-078-chunshen"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji078-030","person_id":"cbr-p004468","surfaces":["周公"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-078-chunshen"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-078-chunshen:p019","quote":"春申君相二十五年，楚考烈王病。朱英謂春申君曰：「世有毋望之福，又有毋望之禍。今君處毋望之世，事毋望之主，安可以無毋望之人乎？」春申君曰：「何謂毋望之福？」曰：「君相楚二十餘年矣，雖名相國，實楚王也。今楚王病，旦暮且卒，而君相少主，因而代立當國，如伊尹、周公，王長而反政，不即遂南面稱孤而有楚國？此所謂毋望之福也。」春申君曰：「何謂毋望之禍？」曰：「李園不治國而君之仇也，不為兵而養死士之日久矣，楚王卒，李園必先入據權而殺君以滅口。此所謂毋望之禍也。」春申君曰：「何謂毋望之人？」對曰：「君置臣郎中，楚王卒，李園必先入，臣為君殺李園。此所謂毋望之人也。」春申君曰：「足下置之，李園，弱人也，仆又善之，且又何至此！」朱英知言不用，恐禍及身，乃亡去。"}],"rationale":"按全22段明示姓名與局部敘事暫接。太子完考烈王、李園女弟與所生太子楚幽王按明示敘事分存，血緣不當已核定史實。更立君後的君未解，實楚王評論指春申權勢，王長反政與君子為王只作假設；未把方案當實授。秦楚齊王稱分範圍，先君善秦未強接頃襄；朱英郎中未行，伊尹周公引古不補未見身份。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-078-chunshen:p019","text":"春申君相二十五年，楚考烈王病。朱英謂春申君曰：「世有毋望之福，又有毋望之禍。今君處毋望之世，事毋望之主，安可以無毋望之人乎？」春申君曰：「何謂毋望之福？」曰：「君相楚二十餘年矣，雖名相國，實楚王也。今楚王病，旦暮且卒，而君相少主，因而代立當國，如伊尹、周公，王長而反政，不即遂南面稱孤而有楚國？此所謂毋望之福也。」春申君曰：「何謂毋望之禍？」曰：「李園不治國而君之仇也，不為兵而養死士之日久矣，楚王卒，李園必先入據權而殺君以滅口。此所謂毋望之禍也。」春申君曰：「何謂毋望之人？」對曰：「君置臣郎中，楚王卒，李園必先入，臣為君殺李園。此所謂毋望之人也。」春申君曰：「足下置之，李園，弱人也，仆又善之，且又何至此！」朱英知言不用，恐禍及身，乃亡去。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-078-chunshen:m019-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"春申君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004439","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-078-chunshen:m019-0009","start":9,"end":13,"surface":"楚考烈王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004451","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-078-chunshen:m019-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"朱英","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004461","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-078-chunshen:m019-0018","start":18,"end":21,"surface":"春申君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004439","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-078-chunshen:m019-0039","start":39,"end":40,"surface":"君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004439","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-078-chunshen:m019-0056","start":56,"end":60,"surface":"毋望之人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名角色或假設用稱保留，不補姓名、親屬或方案實施；母子血緣敘事仍待另存來源主張與學術覆核。"},{"id":"c-shiji-078-chunshen:m019-0063","start":63,"end":66,"surface":"春申君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004439","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-078-chunshen:m019-0080","start":80,"end":81,"surface":"君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004439","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-078-chunshen:m019-0095","start":95,"end":97,"surface":"楚王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004439","stat